31	// The spool is an optional accelerator on the same filesystem and descriptor
32	// table as correctness-critical state. The byte ceiling includes pessimistic
33	// 32 MiB reservations held by concurrently serializing PDF responses, not only
34	// completed artifact lengths. Hundreds of small retained artifacts plus four
35	// in-flight maximum-sized reservations fit while optional pressure stays below
36	// the fixed ceiling.
